      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s ok if there is a good reason, but it is preferred to take them after they\u0027ve landed via the normal merge. In the past we\u0027ve accepted FROMGIT in android-mainline because of some looming milestone (this is the main reason we take them into GKI branches too).\n\nI\u0027m not aware of any cases right now where there are schedule-pressure reasons why we need to take any FROMGIT patches into android-mainline, so it is preferred to wait until patches land.",
      "parentUuid": "cd1f51ef_38c0aa76",
