      "writtenOn": "2021-10-13T07:32:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That is to be expected.  Your patches were applied to the clk tree on the 14th Sept, 2 days after the merge-window closed.  I would expect patches to be merged at least a week or so before the merge window opens (3 weeks before your patches were actually applied) for consideration for inclusion into an -rc1.\n\nYour patches should be included in the v5.16 merge-window, which should open in either 2.5 weeks (if there is only an -rc7) or 3.5 weeks (if the release candidates reach -rc8).\n\nSo if there are no pressing time constraints, it sounds much like the preferred approach is to wait a few weeks and have them merge organically into android-mainline.",
      "parentUuid": "9ab12317_83e360ba",
